{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/col",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/col.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.1",
      "source_sha256": "758b86f12558ed6b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., he puts forward here the name of apostle, because some among them were disputing it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.2",
      "source_sha256": "230e19b7f03ef587",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Father and Son are at one in my coming to you in apostleship."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.3",
      "source_sha256": "ca5e031da0ffd4b3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as it grows and bears fruit in you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.4",
      "source_sha256": "20cc9706251ed6d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., he is the one who first preached to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.5",
      "source_sha256": "64208dbf4ae04d18",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., knowledge of the Godhead"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.6",
      "source_sha256": "d5ee6b907e1402a2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the anagogical sense"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.7",
      "source_sha256": "8743dab635c56e41",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., knowledge of the divine mysteries"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.8",
      "source_sha256": "d0e5abcb9b18396b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that your good deeds may be many"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.9",
      "source_sha256": "e80c48e4215fd281",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., knowledge of God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.10",
      "source_sha256": "c610ae01e3158740",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., so that we may be in the kingdom with Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.11",
      "source_sha256": "d3d47d932ca5911b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is through him that our sins have been forgiven us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26c.12",
      "source_sha256": "abb49779dfdecae9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the true image of the God of heaven; or: through him God the Father is known"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.1",
      "source_sha256": "2afb6c5dee89aecb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., for it is he who has been raised [from the dead] [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.2",
      "source_sha256": "4b9a98a31adc74eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., so that it may be he who is the sole leader"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.3",
      "source_sha256": "caca6744babfda88",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., all the fullness of the Godhead dwelt in Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.4",
      "source_sha256": "96d3aafa17b148f6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the act of crucifying, whose name is crux"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.5",
      "source_sha256": "0a86803b5ee5a712",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., peace was made between the household of heaven and of earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.6",
      "source_sha256": "462ccfb62600f2bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., in the hope of the future glory that you will have in heaven and that is preached in the gospels"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.7",
      "source_sha256": "aba59092b90650ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., that you have taken an example from us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.8",
      "source_sha256": "f9b6a9eee6d5962f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., what was lacking to me in fulfilling the sufferings of Christ, that is what I am engaged in [?]; so this is what is lacking of it: to go to martyrdom on your behalf."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.9",
      "source_sha256": "5b68c1857c0db106",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the gospel, i.e., the mystery that was foretold of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.10",
      "source_sha256": "79b34e81591afc03",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., in the mysteries of the Godhead, until I made it known to the Gentiles"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.11",
      "source_sha256": "0ee313fd9792c010",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., he has raised up the head [?] of that mystery"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.12",
      "source_sha256": "c513385352381612",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., so that it might be known to them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.13",
      "source_sha256": "e3e40473ccbe82bb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the salvation of the human race"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.14",
      "source_sha256": "783783415633456d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, for even the household of heaven does not know it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.15",
      "source_sha256": "2ec72c892cac0599",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, the knowledge and recognition of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.16",
      "source_sha256": "f0d736f5b31e7d19",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, as Christ was perfect, so may whoever is in union with him be perfect."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.17",
      "source_sha256": "6ab76c864bd0f087",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, I am striving with him in following his work and in avoiding [?], so that I may reach equality with him; and he does the same toward me in this."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.18",
      "source_sha256": "1279c5ca46aee5e8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, his share with him is good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.19",
      "source_sha256": "c4bd643724ef379e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, great is the anxiety I have about you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.20",
      "source_sha256": "0292c5a7a4d73e45",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, the Colossians, then, are in Laodicea."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.21",
      "source_sha256": "27dd9cff44560610",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, so that they may be comforted and not be sorrowful because of my chains."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.22",
      "source_sha256": "6c791b8d7761e4a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, so that they may have love for everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.23",
      "source_sha256": "a4530f6c90ea9766",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, so that they may know how great is the grace God has given them, and so that their understanding may be good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.24",
      "source_sha256": "b06cbf78c60be4d7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, the mystery of the salvation of the human race."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.25",
      "source_sha256": "e3e0c5ada71d0301",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is then that everyone is wise and knowing: after coming to know Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.26d.26",
      "source_sha256": "cad7c7c085c4cd15",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, philosophers. That is, for philosophers are not wiser than you, since you are in Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.1",
      "source_sha256": "998bc59d3b2c7e0e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, steadfast thinking about your perfection."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.2",
      "source_sha256": "7e9b672e9ea7780a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, in the faith in Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.3",
      "source_sha256": "9c38e86fe8e74da7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As it was preached to you, so may it be [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.4",
      "source_sha256": "598b90a15edc4d9c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the unity of his body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.5",
      "source_sha256": "641c911390dabe0e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The apostles first, you afterwards."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.6",
      "source_sha256": "314a7177eb72fab9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Be strong in faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.7",
      "source_sha256": "e609cc2dcd2ebc22",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, give thanks to God for every good thing he does for you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.8",
      "source_sha256": "e4c1ffc4042f379b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, even though they are clever and eloquent in expounding it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.9",
      "source_sha256": "6556e4f89eaee68d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, falsehood in the work."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.10",
      "source_sha256": "5b935d32b64798e9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is the custom of philosophers to explain the elements and to inquire into them, and to disbelieve what is told [?] of Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.11",
      "source_sha256": "c603dc7ccb8a6a25",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, it is not according to Christ that they preach. That is, they do not know how it is, for this is how it is: 'for in him dwells', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.12",
      "source_sha256": "53331ad5819eefa7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pelagius: all the fullness of the divine nature dwells in his body. That is, truly; or, bodily. That is, the fullness of the Godhead has dwelt in his body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.13",
      "source_sha256": "46b8cdf5493c0059",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, a question: what is the circumcision of Christ? It is not hard: death and burial. It is these that bring about circumcision from vices."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.14",
      "source_sha256": "a84a8b71767ecce5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, three waves over us in baptism; a three-day period for him in the sepulchre."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.15",
      "source_sha256": "c7ef2eb9fbdd4e98",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As co-burial has been granted to us, so there is co-resurrection, if we believe in the working of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.16",
      "source_sha256": "b140730bb84968ca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It was there; it had not been forgiven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.17",
      "source_sha256": "b453985ef39e19cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Death has been destroyed for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.18",
      "source_sha256": "77244b4ab472ecb2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It was not for our benefit that it was there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.19",
      "source_sha256": "bd2c51659e7ec0b2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He has taken it away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.20",
      "source_sha256": "c4e7d734c313171a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So that it does not exist at all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.21",
      "source_sha256": "73de6bb7b6a10e9e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So that it was confirmed in blood."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.22",
      "source_sha256": "7e8ccb6bb8d46981",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, he won victory over them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.23",
      "source_sha256": "a30ec02b7567c697",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, through the death of his own body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.24",
      "source_sha256": "b61d6b0b69e84f86",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, let no one judge you, that is, do not let yourselves be brought under the rule of the law of the Old Testament in drink and in food, on the festivals and on the sabbath; rather, let your faith be perfect."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.25",
      "source_sha256": "3bca2b045ee58d7e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, everything that was in the Old Testament is a shadow of the New Testament."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.26",
      "source_sha256": "b65f0a71d94ebd0d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As though he had said: none of this is fitting for you, only humility towards Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.27",
      "source_sha256": "e46ae39938362dc9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, though they say that visions are shown to them and that angels come to them, do not believe it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.28",
      "source_sha256": "bc999c0259192e70",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, it brings no benefit [?] (ut mille [?])."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.29",
      "source_sha256": "2e254057987aa86a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is not in spiritual senses that they boast."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27a.30",
      "source_sha256": "883de9b3817ff567",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, if you have separated from sins through the death of Christ, why do you make friendship with them again? Pelagius: the elements of the world are avarice, luxury, and other things like these."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.1",
      "source_sha256": "df7cdadce6cd8ce1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, because they decay; that is, it has come to destruction [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.2",
      "source_sha256": "34b46560c8dcfca1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, so that the body may not be sated."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.3",
      "source_sha256": "09ab721dad1cca38",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, nor should the flesh be honoured by satiety; or, it is not in feasts or in finery that it is to be cared for."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.4",
      "source_sha256": "441efe20ecd01e10",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, its glory is the more prosperous [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.5",
      "source_sha256": "8339172f7194e448",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, in the glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.6",
      "source_sha256": "a260e3d04036f10f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, if Christ is your life, you will have glory with him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.7",
      "source_sha256": "0d131249e5a77dfc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, it is in that that he is."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.8",
      "source_sha256": "981ba19908529a4c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, these are the members of the old man, and the old man himself is the whole of the vices. So each one of them is a member, and their gathering together is the body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.9",
      "source_sha256": "a236fdbd90b4f7a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, riches are served in the same way that idols are served."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.10",
      "source_sha256": "9ab8f3bed7756eb5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, thinking about sin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.11",
      "source_sha256": "9137926efc4263f7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, put away from you the [?] of the vices."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.12",
      "source_sha256": "347eaf9a5af9a1e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, let none of you tell a lie about another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.13",
      "source_sha256": "fef20eebc1c52b8b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, so that we may be in the image of Jesus, that is, in the unity of his body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.14",
      "source_sha256": "c1c611333490d1f5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, another explanation: no one is higher in rank than another in his sight."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.15",
      "source_sha256": "06f0612474535138",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, to men, that is, those who believe in the divinity and humanity of Christ will have all gifts and all the commandments."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.16",
      "source_sha256": "6c8045da3910cf50",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, put on yourselves the garment of a beloved son, since you are beloved sons. That is, it is 'bowels' (viscera) that he calls the garment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.17",
      "source_sha256": "ae92645adbb5cdd7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Patience of each one toward his fellow."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.18",
      "source_sha256": "5d84b007d415f82b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Whatever may have arisen between you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.19",
      "source_sha256": "6c8cacc4f7f76de9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Forgiveness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.20",
      "source_sha256": "54e638daa2b4049c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, upon you; or, besides all the things mentioned above."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.21",
      "source_sha256": "4bdf96437487e54b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, unity among yourselves, or between you and God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.22",
      "source_sha256": "305dedfe61a51e68",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, on your part toward God, and on God's part toward you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.23",
      "source_sha256": "a861d76e35d07d9d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, to be in the unity of the body of Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.24",
      "source_sha256": "5a018d1358667480",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, give thanks to God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.25",
      "source_sha256": "ceda1e6510e4c523",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let it be a dwelling, not a share of a passing visit. Its dwelling, then, is preaching it and fulfilling it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.26",
      "source_sha256": "e80c48e4215fd281",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., knowledge of God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27b.27",
      "source_sha256": "30025168d4beede7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What he teaches here, then, is that everyone should understand what he sings, so that the meaning in it may be clear to him, and so that he may make it clear to everyone who hears him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.1",
      "source_sha256": "956a898d6e935338",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, in fulfilling the commandments of Jesus and in calling on his name."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.2",
      "source_sha256": "ef4cc113022de19c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Giving thanks to God for your salvation through him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.3",
      "source_sha256": "addff83ecf8b3cb5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the obedience be in the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.4",
      "source_sha256": "33564767204476a1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, since they are subject."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.5",
      "source_sha256": "33738734b2125d14",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, fierce."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.6",
      "source_sha256": "6c13e2e3bbdfaca5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, correction without harshness and without [?] fault."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.7",
      "source_sha256": "8c1058e1d89b398e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. sorrowful"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.8",
      "source_sha256": "7cb200a5c802c25f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he teaches here that servants should obey and serve their masters, so that the masters may not say: \"Our slaves were obedient to us before the faith came; they were disobedient afterwards.\" That, then, is not a fitting thing to be said, says he, for it was not to teach disobedience that it came."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.9",
      "source_sha256": "a8d4cf7f0a134ba2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it should not be only when you are in sight that you do the will of your master."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.10",
      "source_sha256": "1105e6ec262f88aa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. willingly, i.e. let it be for a divine reward."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.11",
      "source_sha256": "41194e623c7d8823",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he would take vengeance on you if you were not obedient, for he knows whether it is from the heart that [?] you do it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.12",
      "source_sha256": "91e9f57237845a7b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you will have the heavenly inheritance as the reward of your obedience."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.13",
      "source_sha256": "b69248b1f0bc70e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he will have punishment for what he has done."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.14",
      "source_sha256": "313fe1f2653f5a73",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. whoever is disobedient, or who does not fulfil what is told him, will have punishment for it, i.e. whether it is the master who does it to his slave or the slave to his master."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.15",
      "source_sha256": "0db50e0295a44156",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but of works, among free and unfree, between slave and master."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.16",
      "source_sha256": "c5a3d9201e71eb11",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is a restraint on the masters, so that they may not use their power over their slaves too much."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.17",
      "source_sha256": "784ec1313dc9523a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as if he had said: you too are slaves, then; your Lord is in heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.18",
      "source_sha256": "f6062a4fb777b099",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is the service to the heavenly Lord, and it is to all of them that he says it. Pelagius: for the prayer of one who is negligent and asleep can obtain nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.19",
      "source_sha256": "9155019c9d26093c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. along with prayer for yourselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.20",
      "source_sha256": "a9acffcc2a4f211a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that our preaching may succeed, and many may be saved through it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.21",
      "source_sha256": "4742142b55168165",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the gospel, i.e. so that I may reveal the mysteries of the incarnation, and of the birth of Christ, and of his passion."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.22",
      "source_sha256": "349ab69e2b18c1c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the reason I am a captive is that I preach that mystery."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.23",
      "source_sha256": "18711d3335b1d0a5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "i.e. without hindrance"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.24",
      "source_sha256": "263e6653a00f5cbc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. preaching the divine mysteries to them, and not burdening them by asking anything of them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.25",
      "source_sha256": "c5c3abf60f022dd4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the laity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.27",
      "source_sha256": "1b5cd22ec4a6567b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The time that you have wasted through your evil deeds, buy it back through your good deeds in the time of the New [Testament]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.28",
      "source_sha256": "e41d63fffe2c6472",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let it bring the grace of the Spirit to your word, for everyone, through the perfection of your preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.29",
      "source_sha256": "7ffa6baf66e033c9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may know the right answer for every rank and every age."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.30",
      "source_sha256": "b1b2772bffc57e9c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "his ministry is faithful"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.31",
      "source_sha256": "09f59cd602e6615d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in serving God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.32",
      "source_sha256": "8c776d2516f2fccf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. hither"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.33",
      "source_sha256": "93e75dcbdf0aa22d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may know the news of us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.34",
      "source_sha256": "07caf026f0c35b48",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., so that you may know, then, the news from me, and so that you may not be sorrowful over my imprisonment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.35",
      "source_sha256": "e508ddfb8616e5d2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., they have been sent together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27c.36",
      "source_sha256": "ddfed246ac4f35fe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., both my imprisonment and the number of those to whom I preach."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.1",
      "source_sha256": "0bb8e5adee16b0e9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Your greeting from them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.2",
      "source_sha256": "91116ca345466ecf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Kinsman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.3",
      "source_sha256": "eff01529e50a7c82",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., he has preached to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.4",
      "source_sha256": "57f6277e9c3edc9a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., they are of the Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.5",
      "source_sha256": "208291e6c0603a4b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "In preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.6",
      "source_sha256": "1eb9a44ccbb8b4c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., his people are from among yourselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.7",
      "source_sha256": "467bb5eca1a05b49",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., he always prays to God for you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.8",
      "source_sha256": "720ff4f26fa2b05c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., I bear witness that his love for you is great."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.9",
      "source_sha256": "6867e9e42a9acb51",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., he loves you all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.10",
      "source_sha256": "16a5cfb56a210d6c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He gives here, then, the name of the work he did at first."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.11",
      "source_sha256": "6014c83e9857508c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Be at peace with them; love good people."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.12",
      "source_sha256": "1dd31f0f5bf23092",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., his whole household."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.13",
      "source_sha256": "5851e12b8f0a6f86",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., but when this epistle has been read to you, let it be taken by you to the Laodiceans, and let the epistle that is written to them be brought so that it may be read to you, so that it may be shown here that nothing has been written to them except [?] what was written to you [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.14",
      "source_sha256": "beaa7015064bc060",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "i.e., so that you may read it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.15",
      "source_sha256": "639d0ca6f4fd6c7b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Preaching to everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/col#Wb.27d.16",
      "source_sha256": "6f291e151dc85949",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "So that it might be thought that it was a scribe who had written it up to this point."
    }
  ]
}
